Portable existing-cluster installation for Agent Substrate v1.0.1.

Base: 20778a6dbb01f13024642851bb592bf67c9fec05.
Adapted from Sam Huber's install-hook work. Replace a deployment-specific
preflight bypass with an explicit nonlocal profile, preserving Kind and GKE
defaults. Read credentials from an operator-managed S3 Secret, carry pinned
source resources without changing directory, and retain upstream image
repository/tag resolution. No local object store or monitoring stack.

